# Forge build output — uploaded wholesale by `forge deploy` (manifest.yml `resources.path`).
/dist-forge/
# Compiled Tailwind for the Forge entry. Written by `build:css:forge`, bundled by Vite from
# inside the Forge Vite root, so it has to live in the source tree.
/forge/production.css
# Forge CLI scratch space. `forge tunnel` writes a snapshot of manifest.yml here at startup —
# machine-local, rewritten every run, and stale the moment the manifest changes.
/.forge/
# Written by the Forge CLI: contains a JWT for the logged-in account. Never commit.
/.container-service-assets/
